OL,3,GNEWSAPatient services boosted by health
OL,4,Ahub expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients will be offered more
OL,7,Fdiagnostic care from mid-December after
OL,8,Fa community health hub underwent major
OL,9,Fexpansion work.
OL,11,FTwo new X-ray rooms, a pre-assessment
OL,12,Fclinic and a new nurse station will be
OL,13,Famong the facilities available at St
OL,14,FMargaret's Community Diagnostic Centre
OL,15,Fin Epping, Essex, from 14 December.
OL,17,FThe centre opened in March, but will
OL,18,Fnow have capacity for up to 350 more
OL,19,Fpatients each day after the size of the
OL,20,Fbuilding was extended.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
